{"4015730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bunny Hopper", "steam_appid": 4015730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bunny Hopper</strong> is a dynamic 3D platformer where you take control of an agile combat robot. Jump, wall-run, dash, and shoot targets as you conquer challenging levels set in stylized arenas.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015730/extras/4b3b749b47fe7524251f50982aa0f8db.avif?t=1762815628\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br>Take command of the combat robot and embark on a series of trials that will test your speed and agility. Each level demands precise movement and lightning-fast reactions. Lasers, chasms, narrow paths, and targets that must be hit on the run turn a simple race into a true test of skill. By combining running, jumping, dashing, and wall-running, you must keep moving forward, avoid traps, and destroy targets. Can you reach the end of the level without falling into the abyss?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015730/extras/1d3805610ba31d17cb68261dff1c9b35.avif?t=1762815628\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br>The game blends elements of classic platformers with arcade shooting sections. Expect vibrant visuals, diverse levels, and a constant flow of action. Master the movement mechanics to achieve top results and unlock new possibilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015730/extras/49940e309f291f3040313222d9bbb9fa.avif?t=1762815628\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Engaging movement system with dashes and wall-running</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Varied levels filled with obstacles like lasers and moving platfo